---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Giulio Lattanzio | Network & Security Specialist"
  description="Portfolio personale e raccolta di contenuti tecnici su networking, Wi-Fi, VoIP, Fortinet e AudioCodes."
>
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="wrap nav-wrap">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">GL</span>
          <span>
            <strong>Giulio Lattanzio</strong>
            <small>Network & Security Specialist</small>
          </span>
        </a>

        <nav aria-label="Navigazione principale">
          <a href="/profilo/">Profilo</a>
          <a href="/posts/">Articoli</a>
          <a href="#stack">Tecnologie</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="wrap hero-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Personal tech portfolio</p>
            <h1>
              Networking, sicurezza e comunicazioni
              <span>raccontati attraverso esperienza e contenuti tecnici.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="lead">
              Sono Giulio Lattanzio, Network & Security Specialist. Questo sito è la mia vetrina professionale:
              racconta chi sono, di cosa mi occupo, le tecnologie con cui lavoro e gli articoli che pubblico su Wi-Fi,
              networking, Fortinet, VoIP e AudioCodes.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="primary" href="/profilo/">Chi sono e cosa faccio</a>
              <a class="secondary" href="/posts/">Leggi gli articoli</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="identity-card" aria-label="Profilo sintetico">
            <div class="identity-top">
              <span class="prompt">C:\&gt; whoami</span>
              <span class="status">online</span>
            </div>
            <div class="identity-main">
              <span class="avatar">GL</span>
              <div>
                <h2>Giulio Lattanzio</h2>
                <p>Network & Security Specialist</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="identity-tags">
              <span>Networking</span><span>Wi-Fi</span><span>Fortinet</span><span>VoIP</span><span>AudioCodes</span>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="profilo" class="section white-section">
        <div class="wrap split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Profilo</p>
            <h2>Una presentazione di chi sono e di cosa mi occupo.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="copy">
            <p class="big-copy">
              Mi occupo di infrastrutture di rete, sicurezza, wireless enterprise e sistemi di comunicazione VoIP.
            </p>
            <p>
              Questo spazio non nasce per offrire servizi o consulenza: è una vetrina personale e professionale.
              Qui presento le aree tecniche su cui lavoro e raccolgo appunti, approfondimenti e contenuti sugli argomenti
              che utilizzo e studio nel tempo.
            </p>
            <div class="inline-actions">
              <a href="/profilo/">Scopri il mio profilo →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="competenze" class="section soft-section">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div>
              <p class="section-label">Aree tecniche</p>
              <h2>I temi su cui lavoro e pubblico.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>
              Ogni area diventerà anche un percorso editoriale, con articoli, note tecniche e approfondimenti.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="topic-grid">
            <a class="topic-card" href="/tags/wifi/">
              <span>01</span><h3>Wi-Fi</h3><p>Wireless enterprise, RF, roaming, site survey e troubleshooting.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="topic-card" href="/tags/networking/">
              <span>02</span><h3>Networking</h3><p>Routing, switching, VLAN, protocolli e analisi del traffico.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="topic-card" href="/tags/fortinet/">
              <span>03</span><h3>Fortinet</h3><p>FortiGate, VPN, policy, sicurezza e troubleshooting.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="topic-card" href="/tags/voip/">
              <span>04</span><h3>VoIP</h3><p>SIP, call flow, integrazioni e qualità delle comunicazioni.</p>
            </a>
            <a class="topic-card" href="/tags/audiocodes/">
              <span>05</span><h3>AudioCodes</h3><p>SBC, routing SIP, manipolazioni e interoperabilità.</p>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section dark-section">
        <div class="wrap article-cta">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label light-label">Knowledge hub</p>
            <h2>Articoli, appunti e approfondimenti tecnici.</h2>
            <p>
              La parte editoriale del sito crescerà nel tempo e diventerà il punto centrale dove raccogliere ciò che studio,
              sperimento e considero utile documentare.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="light-button" href="/posts/">Vai agli articoli →</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="stack" class="section white-section">
        <div class="wrap split">
          <div>
            <p class="section-label">Technology stack</p>
            <h2>Tecnologie e strumenti.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="stack-list">
            <span>FortiGate</span><span>Fortinet</span><span>AudioCodes SBC</span><span>Ekahau</span>
            <span>SIP</span><span>VoIP</span><span>VLAN</span><span>IPsec</span>
            <span>Wireshark</span><span>Microsoft Teams</span><span>Enterprise Wi-Fi</span><span>Wi-Fi</span>
            <span>Survey Wi-Fi</span><span>Analisi Wi-Fi</span><span>Site Survey</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap footer-wrap">
        <div>
          <strong>Giulio Lattanzio</strong>
          <p>Network & Security Specialist</p>
        </div>
        <p>Portfolio personale e knowledge hub tecnico.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; }

  .site-shell {
    --navy: #0b1220;
    --blue: #2563eb;
    --text: #101828;
    --muted: #667085;
    --border: #e4e7ec;
    --soft: #f7f9fc;
    --white: #ffffff;
    background: var(--soft);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }

  .wrap { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: 0 auto; }

  .topbar {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20;
    background: rgba(247, 249, 252, .9);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(228, 231, 236, .9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  }
  .nav-wrap { min-height: 78px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }
  .brand-mark { width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--navy); color: white; font-weight: 800; }
  .brand strong, .brand small { display: block; }
  .brand strong { font-size: 14px; }
  .brand small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; margin-top: 2px; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 26px; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #475467; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 650; }
  nav a:hover { color: var(--blue); }

  .hero { padding: 110px 0 95px; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
  .eyebrow, .section-label { color: var(--blue); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 760px; margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.06em; color: var(--navy); }
  h1 span { display: block; color: var(--blue); }
  .lead { max-width: 760px; margin: 28px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 34px; }
  .primary, .secondary, .light-button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; padding: 13px 18px; font-weight: 750; font-size: 14px; }
  .primary { background: var(--blue); color: white; }
  .secondary { background: white; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .inline-actions { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px; }
  .inline-actions a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 750; font-size: 14px; }

  .identity-card { padding: 28px; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--navy); color: white; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(16,24,40,.16); }
  .identity-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid #243047; }
  .prompt { color: #60a5fa; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; }
  .status { color: #86efac; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .identity-main { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 32px 0; }
  .avatar { width: 64px; height: 64px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #1d4ed8; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; }
  .identity-main h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
  .identity-main p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #94a3b8; }
  .identity-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .identity-tags span { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #2b3850; border-radius: 8px; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; }

  .section { padding: 105px 0; }
  .white-section { background: white; }
  .soft-section { background: var(--soft); }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 100px; align-items: start; }
  .section h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--navy); font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4vw, 3.8rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: 1.05; }
  .copy p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  .copy .big-copy { margin-top: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.5; }

  .section-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr; gap: 80px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .section-head > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .topic-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .topic-card { min-height: 260px; padding: 28px; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; background: white; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .topic-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(16,24,40,.08); z-index: 1; }
  .topic-card > span { color: var(--blue); font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; }
  .topic-card h3 { margin: 42px 0 12px; color: var(--navy); font-size: 22px; }
  .topic-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; }

  .dark-section { background: var(--navy); color: white; }
  .article-cta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 60px; align-items: end; }
  .dark-section h2 { color: white; max-width: 760px; }
  .dark-section p:not(.section-label) { max-width: 720px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.75; }
  .light-label { color: #60a5fa; }
  .light-button { background: white; color: var(--navy); white-space: nowrap; }

  .stack-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .stack-list span { padding: 10px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--soft); border-radius: 8px; color: #344054; font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; }

  footer { background: white; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .footer-wrap { min-height: 120px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .footer-wrap strong { color: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .footer-wrap p { margin: 4px 0 0; }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .hero-grid, .split, .section-head, .article-cta { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 45px; }
    .topic-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .wrap { width: min(100% - 28px, 1160px); }
    nav a:last-child { display: none; }
    .brand small { display: none; }
    .hero { padding: 70px 0; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 13vw, 4rem); }
    .lead { font-size: 16px; }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; }
    .section { padding: 78px 0; }
    .topic-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .topic-card { min-height: auto; }
    .topic-card h3 { margin-top: 28px; }
    .footer-wrap { padding: 28px 0; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>